        <span style="position:absolute;top:16px;left:16px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.45);padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;">Lookbook · Fit Sup</span>
      </div>
